2656, 299.7015, 300.9936, 300.8204, 302.2414, 301.9309, 301.1885, 303.9393, 304.8676, 301.676, 300.7838, 301.8716, 306.0694, 309.2875, 308.5117, 311.4745, 314.5931, 317.8118, 314.5743, 316.1194, 318.2971, 317.4171, 318.5472, 318.4416, 322.9428, 326.9577, 324.8291, 321.1804, 320.4314, 320.1641, 322.596, 321.4663, 320.498, 323.1209, 323.3796, 323.1972, 325.3073, 325.7812, 325.9838, 327.1224, 328.311, 325.6221, 325.0777, 323.1776, 322.3441, 319.5947, 319.689, 320.3797, 319.1611, 320.1382, 321.3748, 322.0372, 322.7112, 323.7136, 323.5031, 322.046, 322.2179, 323.9611, 324.4347, 328.5727, 327.0399, 326.7867, 329.4204, 328.9593, 330.1277, 329.6171, 330.4746, 329.2258, 323.1043, 323.8923, 320.8706, 321.7305, 321.5078, 321.789, 322.6403, 324.266, 322.6543, 322.9745, 324.7239, 323.2382, 322.4723, 324.337, 321.0674, 315.2083, 311.715, 311.1281, 311.1296, 308.0751, 307.6806, 305.3457, 303.2628, 302.4979, 303.2277, 305.1476, 302.8152, 304.0398, 304.4925, 304.7829, 307.045, 310.423, 310.3248, 309.7682, 314.3961, 320.8104, 321.4056, 322.598, 324.0992, 327.5135, 327.4952, 328.9413, 331.3044, 329.6209, 324.5543, 323.5936, 327.5655, 328.0043, 329.152, 325.2105, 323.4897, 321.0552, 320.2227, 320.0121, 322.3618, 323.6541, 323.8355, 323.4702, 324.5007, 328.0964, 329.9621, 330.5533, 331.9784, 332.5837, 332.6233, 330.8083, 327.6467, 330.1949, 329.2816, 336.2343, 338.2288, 341.4155, 341.0066, 336.9851, 341.1487, 342.1267, 345.6882, 350.2428, 347.8205, 353.0101, 353.3928, 355.3005, 353.2588, 353.1107, 352.202, 350.2153, 350.2038, 354.8903, 354.527, 354.3635, 358.5957, 367.6697, 365.6455, 365.6993, 365.565, 367.2107, 365.3954, 365.3249, 365.2092, 367.0051, 363.5635, 366.5963, 369.1913, 373.2375, 374.0667, 374.0203, 373.5058, 375.9521, 375.1867, 373.2159, 368.9327, 363.8094, 362.0707, 359.4086, 356.4248, 358.8252, 358.3816, 361.1481], "summary_html": "<h1>天风CTA(11): 信号来源与交易合约选择下的横截面策略改进</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>本策略将商品期货期限结构的两种不同维度——短期carry（展期收益）和长期期限结构动量（基差动量）——与库存基本面信号组合，构建横截面多空策略。核心逻辑是：短周期内期货价格向现货收敛（SFRR因子，20-100日），长周期内期限结构呈现趋势延续（BM因子，100-240日），再叠加库存供需信号（低库存增速看多），四因子信号叠加后形成稳健的多空组合。该策略之所以有效，是因为这几个因子分别捕捉了不同时间尺度下的定价偏差，且相关性较低（报告实测BM和SFRR日收益相关系数约0.34）。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.55</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>7.9%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>5.1%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-8.6%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3549</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.65</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.86</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.41 / 1.85</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2012</th><th>2013</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.08</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.57</span></td><td>1.88</td><td>0.06</td><td>0.47</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.07</span></td><td>1.73</td><td>1.07</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.4</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.79</span></td><td>1.31</td><td>1.19</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.17</span></td><td>0.64</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.39</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>spot_close</code></td><td>现货价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>inventory_21</code></td><td>库存(21日)</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每 5 个交易日</li>\n<li><strong>信号更新</strong>: 每日计算，每 5 天生效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>59</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3551</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>63.5%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>27.1</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>因子1: BM (Basis Momentum)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">BM_{i,t} = \\prod_{s=t-R}^{t}(1+r_{i,s}^{TN}) - \\prod_{s=t-R}^{t}(1+r_{i,s}^{TF})</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"math-tex\">r^{TN}</span>: 近月合约日收益率</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-tex\">r^{TF}</span>: 远月合约日收益率</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-tex\">R</span>: 动量计算周期（140-220日）</li>\n<li>复现实现: 用 <code>ry</code>（展期收益率）的滚动均值作为 proxy，<span class=\"math-tex\">\\text{bm}_R = \\text{MA}(ry, R)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>因子2: SFRR (Spot-Future Roll Return)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">SFRR_t = \\frac{P_{S,t} - P_{F,t}}{P_{F,t}} \\times \\frac{365}{T_{F,t}}</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"math-tex\">P_S</span>: 现货价格（<code>spot_close</code>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-tex\">P_F</span>: 期货主力合约价格（<code>close</code>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-tex\">T_F</span>: 主力合约到期期限</li>\n<li>复现实现: <span class=\"math-tex\">\\text{sfrr\\_raw} = (P_S - P_F)/P_F</span>（无到期期限数据，省略年化），取滚动均值 <span class=\"math-tex\">\\text{sfrr}_R = \\text{MA}(\\text{sfrr\\_raw}, R)</span>，<span class=\"math-tex\">R \\in \\{20,40,60,80\\}</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>因子3-4: 库存同比增速与二阶增速</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{InvYoY}_t = \\frac{\\text{Inv}_t - \\text{Inv}_{t-252}}{\\left|\\text{Inv}_{t-252}\\right|}</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{Inv2nd}_{t,D} = \\text{InvYoY}_t - \\text{InvYoY}_{t-D}, \\quad D \\in \\{60, 80\\}</div>\n<p><strong>信号叠加法</strong>: 每个因子截面排名后取前20%做多(+1)、后20%做空(-1)。库存因子取反（低库存=看多）。各因子信号求和得到品种总信号，等权分配。</p>\n<h2>改进历程</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮次</th><th>诊断</th><th>行动</th><th>效果</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>首次实现全部4因子+信号叠加, 49变体</td><td>完整实现BM/SFRR/库存/二阶库存, 含单因子和组合</td><td>Sharpe 1.61 (4f_B180_S60_D80_H5)</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>raw best&gt;0.5, 触发CS/TS归一化</td><td>自动扩展为raw+cs+ts, 147变体</td><td>Sharpe 1.67 (CS归一化小幅提升)</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>扩大参数网格, 加入多参数聚合策略</td><td>BM 160-220x5, SFRR 20-80, 多参数均值法</td><td><strong>Sharpe 1.80</strong> (BM=200, SFRR=80表现最佳)</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>关键发现</strong>:</p>\n<ul><li>R3 扩展 BM 到 200 天窗口后 Sharpe 从 1.67 提升到 1.80，说明更长的期限结构动量窗口在我们的数据上更有效</li>\n<li>四因子组合 consistently 优于两因子，说明库存因子提供了额外的预测信息</li>\n<li>多参数聚合法（报告 Section 6.3）Sharpe 1.71，低于最佳单参数组合，但更稳健</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>品种范围</strong>: 全商品期货（约72个品种有效参与）</li>\n<li><strong>持仓周期</strong>: 5天再平衡（最优），10-20天也可行</li>\n<li><strong>已知局限</strong>:</li>\n</ul>  - 原报告使用\"活跃近月合约\"而非主力合约，我们仅有主力合约数据，预期 Sharpe 低于报告原文（报告 Sharpe ~2.5 vs 我们 ~1.8）\n<p>- SFRR 缺少到期期限数据，未做年化调整 - 库存数据非空率约45%，部分品种缺失导致四因子信号覆盖率低于两因子 - 与因子库已有因子（20191226_tianfeng_inv_ry_3f_cont_h5_raw）相关性 0.56，但 Sharpe 显著高于该因子（1.80 vs 1.15）</p>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 0.9842</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.71s</li>\n</ul>"}